{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars Training Camp is a simulation of building the first human base on Mars. It is based on the actual science, plans and proposed technologies of NASA, SpaceX and international partners for the future Mission to Mars. The player meets their team, explores the Starship and Mars landscape by walking or driving a Cyber truck. Player must find ice for oxygen to breathe and hydrogen for rocket fuel, and must build critical facilities. Player must respond to emergencies of fire, low supply of oxygen, meteors, tornadoes and malfunctioning humanoid robots with bad AI.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955000?t=1756826479","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955000/e9b31b8e83b96604a0167d44f76e150304c9f522/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756826479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955000/402bb019a98144993443a6eae30962d50f23d107/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756826479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955000/402bb019a98144993443a6eae30962d50f23d107/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756826479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars Training Camp is a simulation of building the first human base on Mars. It is based on the actual science, plans and proposed technologies of NASA, SpaceX and international partners for the future Mission to Mars. The player meets their team, explores the Starship and Mars landscape by walking or driving a Cyber truck. Player must find ice for oxygen to breathe and hydrogen for rocket fuel, and must build critical facilities. Player must respond to emergencies of fire, low supply of oxygen, meteors, tornadoes and malfunctioning humanoid robots with bad AI.\u00a0</p>","d